            "name": "Autumn Storm",
            "description": "Knocks back enemies in the target area and deals damage.",
            "type": "ultimate"
          }
        ],
        "pick_when": [
          "Your draft can capitalize on early picks and snowball lane leads",
          "Your team can engage first, letting Arli second-wave into low-health targets",
          "The enemy draft includes Kaizer and Angela, who appear in counter data as matchups Arli can pressure."
        ],
        "avoid_when": [
          "The team needs sustained team-fight damage rather than a single-target diver",
          "Your team has no primary engage, leaving the cleanup pick with nothing to follow up on",
          "The enemy already drafted Donghuang and Daji, who counter data identifies as direct answers to Arli."
        ],
        "power_spikes": [
          "Early game: farm safely behind the support, surviving lane phase to reach the marksman scaling window.",
          "Ultimate unlocked: Autumn Storm converts mobility into burst, the moment Arli starts threatening picks across the map",
          "Late game: with full damage online, sustained DPS outpaces enemy healing in extended fights."
        ],
        "common_mistakes": [
          "Engaging without follow-up — gap-close gets you to the target, but a solo dive without ally damage trades 1-for-1.",
          "Engaging first instead of second — cleanup picks lose their value as primary engagers.",
          "Ignoring Donghuang and Daji on the enemy team when picking fights — counter data flags them as direct answers, so engage timing must respect their cooldowns.",
          "Auto-attacking through enemy dive instead of repositioning — losing the marksman in early fights collapses the late-game win condition."
        ],
